option.CLOUD_DENSITY=密度
option.CLOUD_DENSITY.comment=Adjusts the thickness of clouds.

option.CLOUD_LAYER_HEIGHT=云层高度
option.CLOUD_LAYER_HEIGHT.comment=Sets the vertical position of clouds.

option.CLOUD_MARCHING_STEPS=光线步进步数
option.CLOUD_MARCHING_STEPS.comment=Controls detail level for cloud raymarching.

option.CLOUD_QUALITY=云层分辨率
